    "title": "Salinas Planning Comission rejects appeal of Northridge Mall on Dave & Buster's safety concerns - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Sergio Berrueta ,\n1 hours ago SALINAS, Calif. (KION-TV) - The Salinas Planning Commission has rejected the appeal from Steerpoint Capital and Cox, Castle, and Nicholson over Dave & Buster's on Wednesday. The firm filed an appeal against the construction of a Dave & Buster's, citing that it would increase crime around the old Sears building area and the surrounding neighborhood. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
